  "bugs_found_and_fixed_during_validation": [
    "stop_app() left a rmac-text-editor process running: the tracked launcher pid exited on its own (unrelated to the SIGTERM) while a long-lived grandchild, reparented to systemd --user, survived in the same process group. Fixed by re-scanning by process-group membership (which survives reparenting) after every stop and force-killing any survivor by pid, regardless of whether wait() reported success.",
    "discover_binary() only looked in ~/.local/libexec/rmac and /usr/libexec/rmac (where the shell surface units run from) and missed /usr/bin, where packaged applications without a dev override actually live (e.g. rmac-notes). Fixed by adding /usr/bin to the search path."
  ],
